---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import '../../styles/about.css';
import { translationsFor } from '../../i18n/routes';
---
<Base
  lang="en"
  title="About Us - NS Reptiles | Exotic Animal Breeder, Novi Sad"
  description="NS Reptiles - exotic animal breeder in Novi Sad since 2019. Reptile breeding, custom-made terrariums and aquariums, expert advice and support."
  path="/en/about.html"
  ogDescription="Meet NS Reptiles - an exotic animal breeder in Novi Sad. Reptile breeding and custom terrarium building since 2019."
  active="about"
  translations={translationsFor("/en/about.html")}
>
<section class="about-hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="eyebrow" style="color: var(--green-light)">About Us</div>
        <h1>From hobby to<br><b>leading breeder</b></h1>
        <p>
          For over five years, we've been helping exotic animal lovers in Novi
          Sad and across Serbia provide the best possible home for their pets.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
<section class="section story">
      <div class="wrap story-grid">
        <div class="story-illu reveal">
          <img src="/style/img/gallery/2.jpg" alt="Bearded dragon - NS Reptiles">
        </div>
        <div class="story-text reveal">
          <div class="eyebrow">Our Story</div>
          <h2>A passion that<br>grew into a business</h2>
          <span class="tag">"It all started from a love for reptiles."</span>
          <p>
            <strong>NS Reptiles</strong> is an exotic animal breeder founded in
            <strong>2019</strong> in Novi Sad, after many years of personal
            hobby - keeping and breeding reptiles. What started as a passion for
            bearded dragons and geckos gradually grew into a serious business and
            a community of people who share the same love.
          </p>
          <p>
            Today we offer a wide range of different exotic animals, as well as
            equipment, food and decorations - everything needed for a healthy and
            happy life for your pet. In addition, we build
            <strong>custom terrariums and aquariums</strong>, tailored to the
            specific species, its needs and the space where it will live.
          </p>
          <p>
            We believe that a good home for a reptile is not just a glass box -
            it's a carefully designed ecosystem. That's why every animal comes
            with expert advice, because we want both you and your pet to be
            satisfied in the long run.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
<section class="section tl">
      <div class="wrap tl-head reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow center">Our Journey</div>
        <h2 class="sec-title">How we <b>grew</b></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="timeline">
          <div class="tl-item reveal">
            <div class="tl-year">2019</div>
            <h3>Founded</h3>
            <p>
              A long-time hobby grew into a business - we started breeding
              reptiles and building a community of exotic animal enthusiasts.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="tl-item reveal">
            <div class="tl-year">2020</div>
            <h3>First terrarium builds</h3>
            <p>
              We began building custom terrariums and aquariums - each piece
              tailored to the animal's needs and the customer's space.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="tl-item reveal">
            <div class="tl-year">2022</div>
            <h3>Expanding our range</h3>
            <p>
              We expanded our assortment to include equipment, food, decorations
              and aquatics. Everything in one place for your pets.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="tl-item reveal">
            <div class="tl-year">2026</div>
            <h3>1000+ happy customers</h3>
            <p>
              We've earned the trust of customers across Serbia - over 300
              healthy animals and hundreds of terrariums and aquariums built.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
<section class="section values">
      <div class="wrap values-head reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow center">Why Choose Us</div>
        <h2 class="sec-title">What we <b>believe in</b></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="wrap bento">
        <div class="vc tall reveal">
          <span class="num">01</span>
          <div class="vc-ic">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="30" height="30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
              <path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="vc-body">
            <h3>Health comes first</h3>
            <p>
              Every animal we offer is carefully bred, healthy and tame. Before
              going to a new home, it goes through our care and checks -
              because a good start means a long and happy life. We pay attention
              to keeping conditions, diet and adaptation, and we pass on
              everything you need to know so your pet feels safe and cared for
              from day one.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="vc wide reveal">
          <span class="num">02</span>
          <div class="vc-ic">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="30" height="30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M2 12l5-5 10 10-5 5z"></path>
              <path d="M14 7l3-3 3 3-3 3"></path>
              <path d="M7 17l-3 3"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="vc-body">
            <h3>Custom-made builds</h3>
            <p>
              We don't believe in "one size fits all" solutions. We build
              terrariums and aquariums according to the species, the animal's
              habits and the space where it will live.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="vc accent reveal">
          <span class="num">03</span>
          <div class="vc-ic">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="30" height="30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M20.8 4.6a5.5 5.5 0 00-7.8 0L12 5.6l-1-1a5.5 5.5 0 00-7.8 7.8l1 1L12 21l7.8-7.6 1-1a5.5 5.5 0 000-7.8z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="vc-body">
            <span class="big">1000+</span>
            <h3>Customer trust</h3>
            <p>
              Happy customers across Serbia and excellent reviews - your trust
              is our greatest reference.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="vc c04 reveal">
          <span class="num">04</span>
          <div class="vc-ic">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="30" height="30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M21 11.5a8.4 8.4 0 01-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 01-7.6 4.7 8.4 8.4 0 01-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.4 8.4 0 01-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 014.7-7.6A8.4 8.4 0 0112.5 3H13a8.5 8.5 0 018 8z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="vc-body">
            <h3>Advice every step of the way</h3>
            <p>
              Our job doesn't end with the sale. We're here for questions about
              diet and care - before and after purchase.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="vc c05 reveal">
          <span class="num">05</span>
          <div class="vc-ic">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="30" height="30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M12 2l2.4 7.4H22l-6 4.6 2.3 7.4-6.3-4.6L5.7 21 8 14 2 9.4h7.6z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="vc-body">
            <h3>Quality without compromise</h3>
            <p>
              We choose proven equipment and materials. Better to get it right
              once than to go cheap twice - for both the animal and for you.
              From lighting and heaters to decorations, we only recommend what
              we would use ourselves, because reliable equipment means fewer
              worries and a healthier animal in the long run.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
<section class="cta">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="eyebrow center">Ready for the next step?</div>
        <h2>Find your <b>perfect pet</b></h2>
        <p>
          Whether you're just starting out in the world of reptiles or looking
          for a custom terrarium - we're here to help. Get in touch, we'll be
          happy to advise you.
        </p>
        <div class="cta-btns">
          <a href="/" class="btn" style="background: #fff; color: var(--green-dark)">Browse our offer</a>
          <a href="https://wa.me/381693301474" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-light">WhatsApp</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


</Base>
